      "text": "During construction, Main Building floors 1–3, its third-floor rear entrance, and the Parking Lot A route to Central Library are closed and may be omitted from guidance. The accessible alternative runs via Parking Lot C, the Student Centre accessible entrance, and the library’s official west entrance; restroom users should turn left from the Main Building. Outdoor diversion may impose heat and travel burdens, and mobility companions may reconfirm distance and slope."
